It sends the AI requests of a Gladys Assistant instance (chat messages, the
history, tool definitions and results, chat images) to the OpenRouter API
(https://openrouter.ai), which forwards them to the provider of the model the
administrator chose, with the API key of the administrator, and returns the
answers to Gladys.

